Description:It is your second main phase. You control no creatures and have Dragon Fodder and Burn Trail (3 damage to any target; conspire) in hand, with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-conspire-new-tokens | Conspire taps two untapped creatures you control that share a color with the spell as an additional cost and copies it (CR 702.78a); tapping for a cost is not a {T} ability, so creatures that just arrived may be tapped: Dragon Fodder's two red Goblins conspire Burn Trail for 3 + 3; Burn Trail alone deals 3
